# Statue 499
# Simple statue with pedestal and torch eyes
# Origin is the player's position (~ ~ ~) when running the function.

fill ~0 ~0 ~0 ~4 ~0 ~4 polished_andesite
fill ~1 ~1 ~1 ~3 ~2 ~3 stone_bricks
fill ~2 ~3 ~2 ~2 ~8 ~2 cobblestone
setblock ~1 ~6 ~2 cobblestone
setblock ~3 ~6 ~2 cobblestone
fill ~1 ~9 ~1 ~3 ~10 ~3 stone_bricks
setblock ~1 ~10 ~2 torch
setblock ~3 ~10 ~2 torch
say 🗿 Statue 499 complete!
